<title>USA: Boca revamps operations, cuts 30 employees.</title>
<headline>Boca revamps operations, cuts 30 employees.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boca Research Inc said Monday that it has implemented a plan to streamline its operations, reducing its workforce by about 30 full-time employees and 30 contract agency personnel.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said it is cutting any duplications of services and reassessing services from outside vendors and agencies whose responsibilities can be reassigned to Boca Research employees.</p>
<p>Industry-wide demand for data communications products remains weak, said Boca, which added that it is in the transitional, ramp-up period for its new products.</p>
<p>Boca makes data communications, videoconferencing, multimedia and networking products for use with personal computers and computer networks.</p>
